{"id": "valpaca0017", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Sure, bad minton is a fast- paced racquet sport played with a shuttlecock and two players or teams. The objective is to hit the shuttlecock over the net into your opponent's court in such a way that they can't return it. You score points when your opponent fail s to return the shuttle cock within the boundaries of the court or hits it out of bounds. Each game is usually played best of three sets. To start, one player serves the shuttle cock diagon ally across the court. Players must keep the shuttlecock in play by hitting it back and forth, aiming for speed, accuracy, and strategic placement. Common shots include clear shot s and smashes, which are powerful downward shots.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 35, "carrier_ended": null}
