{"id": "valpaca0053", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, the relationship between Julius Caesar and Cleopat ra was a complex one. It began when he arrived in Egypt in 48 BC to help settle a power struggle. He fell for Cleopatra's charm and intelligence, and they formed a political alliance that eventually turned into a romantic affair. They had two children together, but their relationship was marked by political intrigue and ended with Ca esar's assassination in Rome. Despite the challenges, their bond was significant in Roman history and remains a fascinating part of ancient politics and romance.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0057", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 14, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "That's a great idea. I love Uk rainian food, and o kroshka is one of my favorites. It' s like a cold soup, kind of refreshing for summer. You can make it with kefir or yogurt as the base. Then you add boiled eggs, sometimes chopped cuc umbers, tomatoes, and green onions. Some people also throw in pickles or be tters for flavor. You just mix everything together and chill it before serving. It' s simple but really tasty. Would you like more details on the ingredients?", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 27, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0061", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Of course, I can help you with that. Sewing a button on a shirt is actually quite simple if you have the right tools and follow the steps carefully. First, make sure you have a needle, thread that matches your shirt, and a new button. If you don't have a needle already threaded, thread it through the eye of the needle by gently pushing it from one side or using a needle thread er if needed. Next, find the spot where the button should go—usually just below the existing buttonho le or in the same position as the original button. Lay the shirt flat so you can see both sides clearly. Start by making a small stitch about halfway between the top and bottom edge of the button area to secure the thread. Then, go around the back of the button several times, keeping the stitches close together but not too tight, or else the fabric might tear. After circling the back, come back to the front and make a few more stitches securing the button firmly in place. Finally, tie a knot at the end of the thread on the back side to keep everything secure. If you're unsure about how many stitch es to use, doing three or four strong loops on each side usually works well. Do you want me to walk you through any specific part of this step-by-step process?", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 51, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0065", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Okay, so to make a bubble solution you will need a bowl of water and some soap. You can also add some glycerin or corn syrup to help the bubbles last longer. Just mix everything together until it's well combined and then dip your wand into the mixture.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 6, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0069", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Yeah, absolutely. One easy way to clean a showerhead is to remove it and soak it in a vinegar solution for about 30 minutes or so. Just put it in a bowl with white vinegar, let the acid dissolve any mineral deposits, then rinse it off thoroughly under running water. It’ s simple and usually does the trick without needing harsh chemicals.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0073", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "So the best way to defrost a refrigerator freeze r is to turn off the fridge, remove all of the items from inside, and then leave it open for at least 24 hours. You can use warm water or a hairdry er on low heat to help melt any ice faster. Just be careful not to overheat anything.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0077", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 14, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I'd love to. Opor ayam is a chicken soup that' s made with coconut milk and spices, such as galangal, lemongr ass, turmeric, and k encur. You can also add ginger and shallots for extra flavor. To make it, you'll need about two pounds of chicken pieces, one can of coconut milk, four cups of water, and the spices listed above. First, you want to blend the spices into a paste using a food processor or mortar and pest le.Then, you' ll heat some oil in a large pot over medium heat and sauté the spice past e until fragrant. Add the chicken and cook until brown ed on all sides. Next, pour in the coconut milk and water, bring to a boil, then reduce the heat and let it simmer for about an hour or until the chicken is tender. You can serve it over rice or with some roti john ny. It's really delicious and perfect for a casual meal at home.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 37, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0081", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, Montgomery has a lot of historical sites. You can visit the Dexter Avenue King Memorial Church where Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. was once past or. There's also the National Museum of African American History and Culture which is located in nearby Washington DC but it covers many aspects of African American history including events that took place in Alabama like the Montgomery Bus Boycott.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0085", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 14, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Sure, I'd be happy to help you with that. Mil anese de pescado is a classic Argent inian dish made with bread crumbs and fish or seafood fillets. Here's how you can make it at home: Start by pre heating your oven to 37 5 degrees F ahrenheit or about 1 90 degrees Celsius. Then, take some firm white fish like cod or s ilver perch and cut it into thin fillets. You will also need breadcrumbs, beaten eggs, salt, pepper, and olive oil for frying. First, coat each fil let in flour, then dip it in the beaten eggs, and finally press it gently into the breadcr umbs to ensure they stick. Once all your pieces are coated, heat a little olive oil in a shallow pan over medium heat. Care fully place the milanesas in the pan and cook them on both sides until they are golden brown. This should take about three to four minutes per side. After cooking, transfer the milanesas to a baking sheet lined with parchment paper. Bake them in the preheated oven for another five to seven minutes just to finish cooking through. For serving, you", "eot_seen": false, "n_ans_chunks": 60, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0089", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Of course I can. Ra cquet ball is a sport played with a small rubber ball and a racket in an en closed court. The objective of the game is to hit the ball against the front wall so that your opponent cannot return it. Players start by serving the ball from below their chest level towards the front wall, aiming for the lower half of the court. If the serve touch es any other part of the court' s walls before hitting the front wall, it results in a fault, and you get another chance to serve. Once both players have served successfully, they take turns hitting the ball back and forth against the front wall until one player miss es or makes an illegal shot. A point is scored when the opponent fails to return the ball within the allowed area or breaks specific rule s during play.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 41, "carrier_ended": null}
