{"id": "valpaca0105", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Indonesia is an archipelago of more than 17,00 0 islands located in Southeast Asia. It's the fourth largest country by population and occupies a vast area between the Indian and Pacific Oceans. The capital city is Ja karta, though the government has plans to relocate it to a new capital on the island of Borneo called Nusantara. Indonesia' s rich culture, diverse ethnic groups, and stunning natural landscapes make it a unique and vibrant part of the world.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
